## 4. Institutional & Educational Usage

While schools, universities, community networks, and Métis organizations are highly encouraged to integrate this platform into their curriculum, **deployment of the backend database or ingestion of the language datasets into institutional servers requires explicit, written permission.**

To request institutional authorization or to arrange a cultural-use license, please contact the project maintainers directly (see `README.md` for contact details).

